# Audit documents are working notes, not the record. The findings that survive an
# audit get written into DECISIONS.md or ROADMAP.md, which are tracked; the audit
# file itself is scaffolding and would otherwise sit in `git status` forever. The
# 7 Aug 2026 revision deleted three earlier audits by decision for the same reason
# - a document that carries method rather than conclusions stops being read for
# either. Ignored by pattern rather than by name so the next one needs no edit.
*-AUDIT.md
*-AUDIT-*.md
